## Development

```bash
devenv shell --no-tui -- uv sync
```

## Verify

Run the checks with Testee. Testee 0.5.0 starts its own clean devenv shell.

```bash
testee verify          # quick profile (partial gate)
testee verify --full   # full gate
testee check pytest    # one named check
testee report          # latest summary
```

Testee writes run state to `.testee/`. Git ignores this directory.
Commit `devenv.lock` and `uv.lock`. Testee warns when Git ignores `devenv.lock`.
